{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act40side_level_act40side_06_end",
  "groupId": "act40side",
  "stageId": "act40side_06",
  "title": "胜肉火方",
  "storyCode": "OR-6",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act40side/level_act40side_06_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "2255db8774f6e2c6b6b4afa4eacc13570135d5b6ce01d809de6b72c224337374",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "58_g12_ningfucourtyard"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁述",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1614_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你那位朋友这么快就走了？也不留人家吃个饭？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......她还有别的要紧事，没法久留啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁述",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1614_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "从小到大，都不见你带朋友回来，还想着可以认识一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或许，也算不上是朋友......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "老人看着垂头丧气的宁茵，想说些什么，却终究没有开口，只是伸手拂去了她肩头的落叶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁述",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1614_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快要走了，还有好多事放不下吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......爷爷也是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁述",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1614_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵呵，前些日子总盼着赶紧回去，真要走了，看着这一草一木，又都放不下了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁述",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1614_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还记得吗？当年就在这亭子里，铺一层沙，拾一根棍，一笔一画地教你写字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁述",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1614_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你当时和我说，来年，府上所有的对联都要由你来写。我陪你练了两个月，最后你自己坚持不下去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁述",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1614_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "结果第二年，你还真送了我一副对联。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁述",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1614_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“花好月圆吃得饱，天长地久......”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这些事，爷爷都还记得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁述",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1614_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪能忘呢......又是一年中秋，日子过得真快啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁述",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1614_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们爷孙两个是不是很久没这样聊过天了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯。最近我一直出门在外，爷爷您也忙着接待客人，见面的机会都很少。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁述",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1614_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这次举家离京，折腾得不轻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁述",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1614_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过回到琅珆就清净了，路上也有大把时间让我们谈天说地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁述",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1614_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你自己的那本书，终于要写完了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "爷爷，我可能......不能和你一起回琅珆了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁述",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1614_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......何时做的决定？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "宁茵轻轻摇头，身子却往后退了几步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "爷爷此次归乡，是叶落归根，人之常情，家里人都非常明白。然而路途遥远，换谁也放心不下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "宁家人才辈出，每个人都为大炎做着举足轻重的工作。相比下来，若要有一个人陪您回去，没人比我更合适。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过话说回来，我本就是琅珆远房遗孤出身，多亏爷爷怜悯，才能在这宁府住了几十年。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如今前往琅珆，也算是回到父母生前故居了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁述",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1614_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当时你主动要求陪我回乡......是这么想的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......爷爷，我本来是这么想的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一切都合情合理，我几乎都要说服自己了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但这几日，为了给《百灶食珍录》结尾，我抱着告别的心思，又一次游历了百灶的大街小巷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......可我发现自己所有的回忆，都与这座城市有关。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我能清楚地记得，院中那棵柿树是哪年栽下的，何时的果子最适合酿酒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还有街头巷尾的各家餐馆，它们的厨师各自有什么样的脾性，同一道菜又有多少种不同的做法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我突然发现，比起这座宁府的宅子，这座城市，才更像是我的家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁述",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1614_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁述",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1614_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......怪我，怪我没有早些问你的想法。这阵子都是我自作主张了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "爷爷，从小到大，您就是我唯一的亲人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当初我的确想和您回故乡，而如今坚持留在百灶......也是因为爷爷您。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁述",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1614_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因为我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我最开始加入太史阁，参与编写史书时，有件事一直让我百思不得其解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大炎数千年的历史，突然从某个节点开始，推广文字，普及教育。一些研究用的碑文，最早也就能追溯到那个时期。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想，在那个时代，一定有人推动了这些变革。可我翻阅了几乎所有资料，却找不到一丝线索。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我有一种奇怪的感觉，大炎的史书上，仿佛缺失了一个人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁述",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1614_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "直到有次，我在一间棋馆遇到了个怪人，他和我讲了关于“那个人”的故事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我原先以为他只是个故弄玄虚的说书人，可是在后续的研究中，我渐渐发现，他和我说的那些故事，居然一一被印证了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在他的叙述里，“她”是个温柔的人，为天下苍生，付出了太多心血......可为何这样一个好人，却没法在史书上留下一个名字？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那时我才意识到，原来史书从来不是一个容器，而是一把筛子。能留下的故事，少之又少。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "爷爷......我想要记录下您的故事。可是我回过头来，却突然发现，与您相伴几十年，我竟然都没有办法清晰地写下您......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "写下您，是一个什么样的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "宁茵终于抬起头，直视着老人的眼睛。\n她期待着老人会回答，回答她没有说出口的疑问。\n她等了很久。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "58_g4_baizaomainstreet_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大理寺官员A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1631_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有动静！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大理寺官员B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1632_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪有动静？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大理寺官员A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1631_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘶......总觉得听到了什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大理寺官员A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1631_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可能是这几天见的古怪案子太多了，总觉得不知道什么时候就有人要跑来闹事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大理寺官员B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1632_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这可是大理寺，哪个拎不清的敢闯这里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大理寺官员B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1632_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别神神道道的了，站完这班岗赶快下班回家了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "待会先从正门进......就说自己是来报案的，再在去等候室的路上找到楼层的地图......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "昨天那个等候室的窗户朝北，大理寺正门朝南，背面是高筑的围墙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "麟青砚的办公室在三楼......从窗户翻出去，顺着消防管道往上爬，不会被发现。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等找到那家伙，*炎国粗口*先给她一拳......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谁？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "58_g4_baizaomainstreet_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "麟青砚？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1644_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "煌？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1644_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你怎么在这？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我怎么在这？我来抓你回去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你那身官服去哪了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1644_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我辞官了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1644_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "回到酒店看到你人不在，就怕你做蠢事，还真是怕什么来什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1644_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我们换个地方再说！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "35_g13_yanlivingroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是说，这么多年以来，顾筌其实一直都停留在宁府？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可你是怎么打听到的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你就别管那么多了。你能不能直接告诉我，这到底意味着什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1644_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "宁尚书与顾筌一案的牵扯比我想象的还要深，之前他的证言显然有所隐瞒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1644_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然我一度怀疑过他就是行凶者，可是按莫不服的证词，如果顾筌当年为旧案伸冤而被打入死狱，而宁述是救他出来的那个人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1644_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那他便没有动机再次谋害他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1644_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最关键的是......我之前从不知道，虞澄竟然早已与顾筌有过接触。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1644_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这一系列事背后的关联，可能比我想象的还要复杂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我还是很好奇，我爸当年孤身一人来到百灶，他到底是想做什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1644_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这才是最关键的问题......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1644_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（煌对于顾筌的两段人生一无所知......如果顾筌的确是当年案件的受牵连者，又为何要在十几年后回到百灶，将自己置于漩涡中央？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1644_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（宁述的立场、虞澄的谋划......这些问题还是没有头绪。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1644_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（我又该如何让煌知道......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，你干嘛又是一副欲言又止的表情？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我们接下来到底该怎么办？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1644_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "煌，昨天的事......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "算了，我知道你们“职责在身”的人，时不时就要干点不正常的事，都懒得和你们计较。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要你别再说什么为了我的安全，让我一个人回去之类的蠢话——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1644_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你还打算赶我走？？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1644_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "煌，你相信我，这件事，我一定会一查到底......只是，你不能继续留在百灶了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1644_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "按我之前说的，两天内离开百灶，先去龙门的办事处。那里也不是久留之地，你整顿好就立刻再启程，尽快离开炎国——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我绝不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1644_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不相信我会继续追查下去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我倒是信你，可你自己一个人没有官衔，没有身份，还怎么查案？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1644_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我会想办法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1644_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虞澄可以辞官暗中调查，我也——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我有一个主意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咱们不如做得彻底一点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1644_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你想怎么做？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "煌从口袋中掏出了一封信。\n那是莫不服给她的机会，现在成了她们两人的机会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1644_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "反正我们东奔西跑也问不出个结果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1644_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们去百珍宴，直接找真龙问个清楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "58_g5_dragonpalace"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "陛下，这是礼部拟好的百珍宴与会官员的名单。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "时值佳节，维多利亚、莱塔尼亚、拉特兰等国也遣使节送来贺帖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "请陛下过目。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太尉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1239_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳咳......咳咳咳......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太尉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1239_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "陛下......兵部协同司岁台已经拟定了完整的作战计划。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太尉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1239_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还请陛下......咳咳......过目。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "作战耗费的人力财力、战后恢复诸事，都没有与户部商议过，这作战计划是如何拟定的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太尉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1239_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "知道太傅大人和户部繁忙，兵部就多操了一点心，打这一仗要用的人力钱粮，乃至工部战后修复的花销，这笔账我们都算清楚了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太尉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1239_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "正好，当着陛下的面，太傅大人一块儿看了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "钱粮物资能算，战事一起，大炎子民要流多少血，这也是一笔能算清的账？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太尉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1239_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那太傅的意思是，算不清，就不用算了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太尉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1239_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帷幕后的声音",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1239_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "秋天了......今年北方的收成怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那场灾害过后，大荒城已经尽快恢复了生产。今年的收成，和以往数年相差不多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帷幕后的声音",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那......明年呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "陛下......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帷幕后的声音",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "生年不满百，常怀千岁忧......可时间不多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "事系大炎万民生计，请陛下三思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太尉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1239_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "太傅大人，该议的事，内阁六部，早都不知道议了多少遍，总该到了拿主意的时候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太尉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1239_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "陛下圣意已决，百珍宴上，等陛下宣布即可。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帷幕后的声音",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "天色晚了，眼看要下雨的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帷幕后的声音",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......二位请回吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅&太尉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "臣告退。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "帷幕后的人抬眼望去——\n空荡荡的宫殿，高位之侧，三张坐席并列摆设，居中的那张已经陈旧。\n一声幽微的叹息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "58_g1_yusrestaurant"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老姜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1621_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎哟哎哟......这雨怎么说下就下，淋我一身......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老姜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1621_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一场秋雨一场寒......再过几天都吃不上新鲜蔬菜咯。今年冬天的衣服都还没来得及准备呢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老姜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1621_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大厨，今年的冬菜说什么也得提前开始存了，你趁早把仓库里你那些乱七八糟的东西——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老姜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1621_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大厨......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老姜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1621_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "煌小姐？行箸姑娘？人呢......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "58_g13_yuskitchen"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "平常热闹的后厨此时空无一人，厨具也被归置整齐，局促的空间看上去竟宽敞了不少。\n只有灶火上炖着一锅汤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老姜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1621_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
